#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:tanatech_website_sale.res_config_settings_view_form
msgid "Finance Team (Invoicing)"
msgstr "Équipe financière (facturation)"

#. module: tanatech_website_sale
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:tanatech_website_sale.payment_manual_message
msgid "Go to my customer portal"
msgstr "Accéder à mon espace client"

#. module: tanatech_website_sale
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/tanatech_website_sale/models/sale_order.py:0
msgid ""
"Invoice %(move)s has been generated for web order %(order)s of customer "
"%(customer)s. Please follow up on the invoicing."
msgstr ""
"La facture %(move)s a été générée pour la commande web %(order)s du client "
"%(customer)s. Merci d'assurer le suivi de la facturation."

#. module: tanatech_website_sale
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/tanatech_website_sale/models/sale_order.py:0
msgid "Invoicing follow-up — web order %s"
msgstr "Suivi de facturation — commande web %s"

#. module: tanatech_website_sale
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:tanatech_website_sale.field_res_company__website_manual_payment_enabled
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:tanatech_website_sale.field_res_config_settings__website_manual_payment_enabled
msgid "Manual Payment (Online Payment Unavailable)"
msgstr "Paiement manuel (paiement en ligne indisponible)"

#. module: tanatech_website_sale
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:tanatech_website_sale.field_sale_order__website_manual_payment_requested
msgid "Manual Payment Requested (Website)"
msgstr "Paiement manuel demandé (site web)"

#. module: tanatech_website_sale
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:tanatech_website_sale.res_config_settings_view_form
msgid ""
"Online payment is disabled: at the payment step the customer is warned that "
"they will be contacted, their cart becomes a quotation, they are redirected "
"to their customer portal and the sales team receives an activity."
msgstr ""
"Le paiement en ligne est désactivé : à l'étape de paiement, le client est "
"informé qu'il sera contacté, son panier devient un devis, il est redirigé "
"vers son espace client et l'équipe commerciale reçoit une activité."

#. module: tanatech_website_sale
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/tanatech_website_sale/models/sale_order.py:0
msgid ""
"Online payment is not available yet: the customer validated their cart on the"
" website and is waiting to be contacted by the sales team."
msgstr ""
"Le paiement en ligne n'est pas encore disponible : le client a validé son "
"panier sur le site web et attend d'être contacté par l'équipe commerciale."

#. module: tanatech_website_sale
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:tanatech_website_sale.payment_manual_message
msgid ""
"Online payment is not available yet. When you validate your order, your "
"quotation is sent to our sales team, which will contact you to finalize your "
"purchase."
msgstr ""
"Le paiement en ligne n'est pas encore disponible. En validant votre commande,"
" votre devis est transmis à notre équipe commerciale, qui vous contactera "
"pour finaliser votre achat."

#. module: tanatech_website_sale
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/tanatech_website_sale/models/sale_order.py:0
msgid "Order total: %s"
msgstr "Total de la commande : %s"

#. module: tanatech_website_sale
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:tanatech_website_sale.payment_manual_message
msgid "Order validation"
msgstr "Validation de la commande"

#. module: tanatech_website_sale
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/tanatech_website_sale/models/sale_order.py:0
msgid "Ordered products:"
msgstr "Articles commandés :"

#. module: tanatech_website_sale
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:tanatech_website_sale.navigation_buttons_manual_payment
msgid "Pay now"
msgstr "Payer"

#. module: tanatech_website_sale
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:tanatech_website_sale.payment_manual_message
msgid ""
"Payment by API is not available yet, you are going to be redirected to your "
"customer portal and our sales team will contact you."
msgstr ""
"Le paiement par API n'est pas encore disponible, vous allez être redirigé "
"vers l'espace client et l'équipe commerciale vous contactera."

#. module: tanatech_website_sale
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/tanatech_website_sale/models/sale_order.py:0
msgid "Prepare delivery — web order %s"
msgstr "Préparer la livraison — commande web %s"

#. module: tanatech_website_sale
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:tanatech_website_sale.field_res_company__website_confirm_delivery_activity_user_ids
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:tanatech_website_sale.field_res_config_settings__website_confirm_delivery_activity_user_ids
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:tanatech_website_sale.res_config_settings_view_form
msgid "Procurement Team (Delivery)"
msgstr "Équipe approvisionnement (livraison)"

#. module: tanatech_website_sale
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/tanatech_website_sale/models/sale_order.py:0
msgid "Quotation: %s"
msgstr "Devis : %s"

#. module: tanatech_website_sale
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:tanatech_website_sale.field_res_company__website_confirm_sale_activity_user_ids
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:tanatech_website_sale.field_res_config_settings__website_confirm_sale_activity_user_ids
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:tanatech_website_sale.res_config_settings_view_form
msgid "Sales Team (Quotation)"
msgstr "Équipe commerciale (devis)"

#. module: tanatech_website_sale
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/tanatech_website_sale/models/sale_order.py:0
msgid "Sales follow-up — web order confirmed"
msgstr "Suivi commercial — commande web confirmée"

#. module: tanatech_website_sale
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:tanatech_website_sale.field_res_company__website_manual_payment_enabled
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:tanatech_website_sale.field_res_config_settings__website_manual_payment_enabled
msgid ""
"When enabled, the payment step of the eCommerce checkout does not create any "
"payment transaction: the customer is warned that online payment is not "
"available yet, their cart is turned into a quotation, they are redirected to "
"their customer portal and the sales team receives an activity to contact them."
msgstr ""
"Lorsque cette option est activée, l'étape de paiement du site e-commerce ne "
"crée aucune transaction : le client est informé que le paiement en ligne "
"n'est pas encore disponible, son panier devient un devis, il est redirigé "
"vers son espace client et l'équipe commerciale reçoit une activité pour le "
"contacter."

#. module: tanatech_website_sale
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/tanatech_website_sale/models/sale_order.py:0
msgid ""
"Web order %(order)s from customer %(customer)s has been confirmed. Please "
"process delivery order %(picking)s."
msgstr ""
"La commande web %(order)s du client %(customer)s a été confirmée. Merci de "
"traiter le bon de livraison %(picking)s."

#. module: tanatech_website_sale
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:tanatech_website_sale.res_config_settings_view_form
msgid "Web Order Follow-up (Tanatech)"
msgstr "Suivi des commandes web (Tanatech)"

#. module: tanatech_website_sale
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/tanatech_website_sale/models/sale_order.py:0
msgid "Web order to be processed — %s"
msgstr "Commande web à traiter — %s"

#. module: tanatech_website_sale
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:tanatech_website_sale.field_res_company__website_confirm_invoice_activity_user_ids
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:tanatech_website_sale.field_res_config_settings__website_confirm_invoice_activity_user_ids
msgid ""
"Users receiving an activity on the invoice generated from a web order "
"confirmed by the customer. If empty, the activity is assigned to the "
"accountant of the invoice or to the salesperson."
msgstr ""
"Utilisateurs recevant une activité sur la facture générée à partir d'une "
"commande web confirmée par le client. Si vide, l'activité est assignée au "
"comptable de la facture ou au vendeur."

#. module: tanatech_website_sale
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:tanatech_website_sale.field_res_company__website_confirm_delivery_activity_user_ids
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:tanatech_website_sale.field_res_config_settings__website_confirm_delivery_activity_user_ids
msgid ""
"Users receiving an activity on the delivery order when a customer confirms "
"their order on the website. If empty, the activity is assigned to the "
"responsible of the transfer or to the salesperson."
msgstr ""
"Utilisateurs recevant une activité sur le bon de livraison lorsqu'un client "
"confirme sa commande sur le site web. Si vide, l'activité est assignée au "
"responsable du transfert ou au vendeur."

#. module: tanatech_website_sale
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:tanatech_website_sale.field_res_company__website_confirm_sale_activity_user_ids
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:tanatech_website_sale.field_res_config_settings__website_confirm_sale_activity_user_ids
msgid ""
"Users receiving an activity on the quotation when a customer confirms their "
"order on the website. If empty, the activity is assigned to the salesperson "
"of the order."
msgstr ""
"Utilisateurs recevant une activité sur le devis lorsqu'un client confirme sa "
"commande sur le site web. Si vide, l'activité est assignée au vendeur de la "
"commande."

#. module: tanatech_website_sale
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:tanatech_website_sale.res_config_settings_view_form
msgid ""
"Users receiving the activity on the delivery orders of a web order. If empty,"
" the responsible of the transfer is used."
msgstr ""
"Utilisateurs recevant l'activité sur les bons de livraison d'une commande "
"web. Si vide, le responsable du transfert est utilisé."

#. module: tanatech_website_sale
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:tanatech_website_sale.res_config_settings_view_form
msgid ""
"Users receiving the activity on the invoice of a web order. If empty, the "
"accountant of the invoice is used."
msgstr ""
"Utilisateurs recevant l'activité sur la facture d'une commande web. Si vide, "
"le comptable de la facture est utilisé."

#. module: tanatech_website_sale
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:tanatech_website_sale.res_config_settings_view_form
msgid ""
"Users receiving the activity on the quotation of a web order. If empty, the "
"salesperson of the order is used."
msgstr ""
"Utilisateurs recevant l'activité sur le devis d'une commande web. Si vide, le "
"vendeur de la commande est utilisé."
